Vibhīṣaṇa arrives with ministers and finds Rāma senseless --- Lakṣmaṇa reports Hanumān news of Sītā slaughter --- Vibhīṣaṇa calls tale untrue like drying ocean --- Rāvaṇa never kills Sītā he begs to free --- Indrajit deludes monkeys and seeks Nikumbhilā rite --- Completed rite makes him invincible even to gods --- Rāma must send Lakṣmaṇa with troops before completion
